WEBVTT

01:40.200 --> 01:43.009
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.130 --> 01:46.009
[Episode 10]

01:46.920 --> 01:48.400
♫A light flickers♫

01:47.789 --> 01:49.789
The Original Goddess and I

01:48.440 --> 01:51.200
♫Far in the distance♫

01:49.810 --> 01:52.100
were in charge of the Baize Imperial Order together.

01:51.420 --> 01:52.560
♫Scars♫

01:52.950 --> 01:54.590
We worked together

01:53.100 --> 01:55.720
♫Nourished gently by rain♫

01:54.590 --> 01:56.229
by each other's side,

01:55.950 --> 01:57.450
♫The window opened by the wind♫

01:57.030 --> 01:59.150
protecting the peace of the Wilderness.

01:57.509 --> 02:02.170
♫Softly sways, but time slips away♫

02:02.580 --> 02:05.060
♫Hastily♫

02:05.110 --> 02:09.389
♫You wear candlelight like a robe, awaiting dawn♫

02:09.650 --> 02:13.860
♫While I cradle heartache, year after year, on and on♫

02:14.280 --> 02:17.050
♫In dreams, my hometown lies under frost♫

02:17.079 --> 02:20.460
♫All sounds♫

02:21.030 --> 02:22.940
♫Are lost♫

02:23.290 --> 02:28.150
♫The wind brushes against rivers and hills♫

02:28.190 --> 02:32.020
♫Wild blooms refuse to fall♫

02:32.329 --> 02:35.320
♫Have echoed for years♫

02:35.390 --> 02:40.190
♫Hoping fate will amend♫

02:40.560 --> 02:44.770
♫Remember me, a humble♫

02:44.850 --> 02:47.060
♫Blossom♫

02:54.790 --> 02:56.660
I thought the Goddess and I

02:57.990 --> 02:59.670
could be like this forever

03:00.750 --> 03:02.550
and never go back on our promise.

03:03.630 --> 03:04.950
But I didn't expect...

03:27.190 --> 03:28.030
Mom.

03:28.030 --> 03:29.730
What’s this mark?

03:30.070 --> 03:32.890
This is the mark of the Baize Order.

03:33.070 --> 03:34.270
Only with this mark

03:34.270 --> 03:35.310
can we hide our demonic energy

03:35.310 --> 03:37.350
in the mortal world

03:37.470 --> 03:39.590
and avoid troubles.

03:40.310 --> 03:41.790
The Baize Order is the reason

03:41.790 --> 03:42.579
why the Human Realm

03:42.579 --> 03:44.510
and the Demon Realm have been at peace.

03:44.510 --> 03:46.570
Be good when you go to the Human Realm.

04:21.940 --> 04:22.740
Fei.

04:23.930 --> 04:25.520
You're a disaster beast.

04:26.150 --> 04:28.310
Once you're seen by people, you'll bring a serious plague.

04:28.310 --> 04:29.870
Wherever you go,

04:29.870 --> 04:31.710
you'll cause massive deaths.

04:31.830 --> 04:34.230
I can't allow you to go to the mortal world.

05:16.930 --> 05:18.950
I searched the entire Wilderness,

05:19.850 --> 05:22.400
but I couldn't find a way to cure the plague.

05:27.030 --> 05:28.510
I told myself that

05:30.100 --> 05:32.400
I must save her

05:33.800 --> 05:35.540
no matter what it takes.

05:37.060 --> 05:40.060
Did you kill so many demons in the Wilderness back then

05:40.170 --> 05:42.640
just to extend the Goddess's life?

05:43.470 --> 05:44.820
I told you

05:46.630 --> 05:48.970
as long as she could live,

05:51.180 --> 05:53.840
I'd pay any price.

05:54.659 --> 05:56.659
You shoulder the responsibility of managing the Baize Order.

05:56.659 --> 05:59.120
You're supposed to protect the Wilderness,

05:59.310 --> 06:02.570
yet you disregarded the lives of demons in the Wilderness.

06:04.310 --> 06:06.150
You committed a heinous crime,

06:07.210 --> 06:09.270
yet you said it was just a price to pay.

06:10.010 --> 06:11.500
The Baize Goddess

06:11.900 --> 06:13.900
was meant to exist for guarding

06:13.920 --> 06:15.450
the peace of the two realms.

06:16.420 --> 06:18.690
If I couldn't even save the Goddess,

06:19.630 --> 06:21.960
how could I possibly save the Wilderness?

06:28.610 --> 06:30.390
For her, I had to

06:31.830 --> 06:33.409
take a chance.

06:33.670 --> 06:36.270
So, was she willing to let you take that chance?

06:38.590 --> 06:40.570
You have the power of the universe,

06:40.880 --> 06:42.880
yet you used it to kill the innocent.

06:43.750 --> 06:45.080
Do you admit your crime?

06:47.080 --> 06:48.510
I killed the innocent.

06:50.230 --> 06:51.820
I know my sins

06:53.510 --> 06:55.180
are unforgivable.

07:01.040 --> 07:02.690
Since you know it's wrong,

07:04.230 --> 07:06.090
why are you still so unrepentant?

07:07.480 --> 07:08.540
That's because...

07:23.540 --> 07:25.930
That's because they were unruly

07:26.930 --> 07:28.500
and fled the Wilderness.

07:29.560 --> 07:31.470
They deserved to die.

07:42.210 --> 07:44.200
No matter what your purpose was,

07:45.770 --> 07:47.380
it's unacceptable.

07:50.020 --> 07:51.450
You are no longer

07:52.710 --> 07:55.190
fit to be in charge of the Baize Order.

08:08.350 --> 08:10.730
I'm taking back that half in you.

09:37.300 --> 09:39.230
The Goddess's original intention

09:39.370 --> 09:41.160
was to seal me.

09:43.530 --> 09:45.260
But she was infected by plague,

09:45.740 --> 09:47.740
and her magical power was weakened.

10:28.920 --> 10:31.040
I took advantage of her exhaustion

10:31.060 --> 10:31.970
and escaped.

10:52.100 --> 10:54.130
I've been hiding in the Wilderness.

10:54.590 --> 10:56.750
I wanted to kill more demons in secret

10:57.630 --> 10:59.090
to extend her life.

11:00.470 --> 11:03.540
You killed others just for your loved one.

11:05.110 --> 11:06.470
You're way too crazy.

11:07.950 --> 11:09.280
You don't even regret it

11:09.520 --> 11:12.700
or feel guilty about the heinous crimes you've committed.

11:12.700 --> 11:14.300
Who said I don't regret it?

11:15.920 --> 11:16.960
I do regret it.

11:19.430 --> 11:21.720
I regret that what I did wasn't enough

11:23.780 --> 11:25.590
to save her.

11:28.030 --> 11:30.630
Perhaps the Goddess already knew everything.

11:30.910 --> 11:33.200
She didn't want you to make more mistakes,

11:33.200 --> 11:34.920
so she committed suicide.

11:36.880 --> 11:38.150
What did you say?

11:40.570 --> 11:42.900
But the Goddess has passed away years ago.

11:44.190 --> 11:46.860
Why are you killing the innocent again?

11:48.870 --> 11:50.090
Zhao Yuanzhou.

11:52.410 --> 11:53.970
What is your desire?

11:55.920 --> 11:57.390
All emotions and desires.

11:57.990 --> 11:59.260
Everything.

12:00.040 --> 12:01.920
And what do you want the most?

12:02.070 --> 12:03.420
I can get

12:04.340 --> 12:06.100
basically whatever I want.

12:09.590 --> 12:10.660
You're right.

12:12.460 --> 12:13.710
You're immortal,

12:14.320 --> 12:16.200
and you can never die of any injury.

12:16.200 --> 12:18.890
This super power you were born with

12:19.850 --> 12:21.890
is enough to make all the demons

12:22.530 --> 12:24.250
envy you.

12:25.560 --> 12:26.910
The rest of my life

12:27.760 --> 12:29.580
will be like traveling in the dark night,

12:29.580 --> 12:30.820
with no light ahead.

12:32.790 --> 12:33.950
There's no past

12:34.470 --> 12:36.010
and no future.

12:37.310 --> 12:39.800
Maybe I'm the opposite of everyone else.

12:41.000 --> 12:42.680
For me, living is torture.

12:44.180 --> 12:45.260
Death

12:46.430 --> 12:48.720
is actually a blessing and relief.

12:51.260 --> 12:52.780
Since you want to die,

12:54.360 --> 12:55.780
why don't you go for it?

12:57.600 --> 12:59.800
This is a world of misery and suffering.

13:00.500 --> 13:02.300
It's hard to get my wish granted.

13:07.340 --> 13:08.910
I can help you.

13:09.270 --> 13:10.400
That won't do.

13:11.420 --> 13:13.590
I've promised someone else.

13:14.190 --> 13:15.690
He'll come to kill me.

13:22.870 --> 13:24.370
He doesn't deserve it.

13:30.760 --> 13:33.270
Since Zhao Yuanzhou wants to die,

13:33.880 --> 13:35.160
how about I help you

13:35.530 --> 13:37.020
kill him?

13:38.110 --> 13:40.060
Then your wish will come true.

13:41.230 --> 13:41.950
And he

13:43.010 --> 13:44.740
can disappear once and for all.

13:45.660 --> 13:47.420
This is between me and him.

13:49.430 --> 13:51.310
I must kill him myself.

13:54.150 --> 13:55.860
I don't need anyone's help.

14:00.690 --> 14:02.750
It's been tens of thousands of years,

14:03.790 --> 14:05.830
yet humans are still so stupid.

14:12.700 --> 14:14.560
I made a big mistake back then,

14:15.030 --> 14:16.830
killing demons to extend my life

14:18.490 --> 14:20.820
and letting the Goddess die with regrets.

14:23.790 --> 14:25.160
So I thought,

14:26.910 --> 14:28.880
if I could go back to the past,

14:29.980 --> 14:32.310
back to when she was healthy and carefree,

14:32.860 --> 14:34.720
back to when there hadn't been

14:35.440 --> 14:37.730
any blood on my hands,

14:40.470 --> 14:41.580
back to

14:43.550 --> 14:46.290
when we were still together...

14:47.390 --> 14:48.920
What are you planning to do?

14:55.590 --> 14:57.510
Rewind the clock

14:58.420 --> 15:00.420
and go back in time.

15:14.350 --> 15:16.880
This magical instrument, sundial, can do it.

15:17.270 --> 15:20.220
As long as I grant enough mortals' wishes,

15:21.080 --> 15:22.640
this magical instrument

15:23.440 --> 15:25.300
will gradually become stronger.

15:27.240 --> 15:28.830
One day,

15:29.870 --> 15:32.080
it'll be able to turn things around

15:32.790 --> 15:34.150
and bring back the past.

15:35.400 --> 15:39.600
This way, I can go back to the time before the Goddess was infected by plague,

15:39.670 --> 15:40.590
and back to

15:43.050 --> 15:45.710
when everything wasn't too late.

15:48.500 --> 15:49.700
Why are you sneering?

15:50.000 --> 15:51.460
Because you're dreaming.

15:52.790 --> 15:54.470
Go back to the past

15:55.220 --> 15:56.880
and turn things around.

15:58.970 --> 16:00.900
Is that what Li Lun told you?

16:01.710 --> 16:02.710
That's right.

16:02.740 --> 16:04.390
Why did he give you this?

16:04.870 --> 16:06.630
Because he wants to know

16:07.130 --> 16:08.920
the secret of the Baize Order.

16:09.430 --> 16:11.490
What's the secret of the Baize Order?

16:18.570 --> 16:19.850
You’re so pitiful.

16:20.670 --> 16:22.200
You were deceived by Li Lun.

16:29.730 --> 16:31.620
Li Lun didn't deceive me.

16:32.750 --> 16:35.180
It's you rat, Zhu Yan,

16:36.070 --> 16:37.730
who wants to deceive me.

16:38.810 --> 16:40.110
This sundial

16:41.270 --> 16:44.560
is the magical instrument I found with Li Lun back then.

16:45.630 --> 16:47.520
It only has one function,

16:48.270 --> 16:50.020
which is to store memory.

16:50.720 --> 16:52.660
It can't rewind the clock.

17:17.050 --> 17:17.780
Sister.

17:17.800 --> 17:21.530
The dress is beautiful, but it's inconvenient to walk around in it.

17:30.660 --> 17:31.920
See?

17:33.050 --> 17:35.570
In this world, the Human Realm and the Demon realm

17:35.570 --> 17:37.190
share the same origin.

17:37.810 --> 17:40.070
There will never be a magical instrument

17:40.300 --> 17:43.030
that can rewind the clock and turn things around.

17:44.870 --> 17:45.880
Cheng Huang.

17:47.900 --> 17:49.220
The ending is settled.

17:51.180 --> 17:53.090
The past is the past.

17:54.690 --> 17:56.300
No way.

17:59.030 --> 18:00.630
You're lying to me.

18:04.030 --> 18:05.630
You must be lying to me.

18:08.800 --> 18:10.150
The one who lied to you

18:12.050 --> 18:13.000
is Li Lun.

18:25.310 --> 18:26.380
He's gone crazy.

18:27.520 --> 18:29.080
He has too many desires,

18:29.270 --> 18:30.960
and he's too involved to see the big picture.

18:30.960 --> 18:31.910
Cheng Huang.

18:33.280 --> 18:35.800
You were willing to be deceived by Li Lun.

18:38.000 --> 18:39.800
Everyone has their own regrets,

18:40.860 --> 18:42.460
but the way of Heaven is fair.

18:43.200 --> 18:45.400
There's no turning back in everything.

18:45.890 --> 18:46.930
Cheng Huang.

18:47.260 --> 18:48.820
Be realistic.

18:49.670 --> 18:51.950
Stop being obsessed with the past.

18:52.390 --> 18:54.070
It's all water under the bridge now.

18:54.070 --> 18:56.930
Turn around and mend your ways before it's too late.

18:59.400 --> 19:01.700
I won't accept it!

19:20.140 --> 19:21.070
Cheng Huang is the demon

19:21.070 --> 19:22.810
that has lived the longest in the Wilderness.

19:22.810 --> 19:24.640
He's suffered such a great shock.

19:24.640 --> 19:25.390
I'm afraid even Brother Zhuo

19:25.390 --> 19:27.790
and Great Demon can't do anything about it.

20:57.720 --> 20:59.340
The original Baize Token

20:59.500 --> 21:01.440
was divided into two halves.

21:01.470 --> 21:03.030
It was jointly managed by the Original Goddess

21:03.030 --> 21:05.550
and the strongest great demon

21:05.630 --> 21:07.280
of the Wilderness.

21:09.120 --> 21:10.720
Turns out I have that half.

22:02.550 --> 22:04.390
Bless everything.

22:04.600 --> 22:06.460
Invulnerable to all evil.

22:06.670 --> 22:08.350
We promise to work together

22:08.520 --> 22:10.960
and guard the Wilderness.

22:09.690 --> 22:14.580
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

22:14.640 --> 22:17.860
♫The dawn stings without hesitation♫

22:17.920 --> 22:21.120
♫The world and universe sing for me♫

22:21.180 --> 22:22.650
♫Spring, summer, autumn, winter; everything becomes nothing♫

22:22.670 --> 22:27.580
♫Heartlessness births a dream♫

22:27.580 --> 22:30.880
♫Mediocre people only believe in their own judgment of right and wrong♫

22:29.190 --> 22:29.910
My God.

22:30.030 --> 22:31.790
So this is the legendary Baize Token.

22:30.920 --> 22:33.840
♫The world is an illusion, like flowers in the mirror and moonlight on water♫

22:34.060 --> 22:39.170
♫I tempered my roar into a blade♫

23:27.800 --> 23:29.110
Baize Token.

23:32.270 --> 23:33.880
I've finally got you back.

25:16.780 --> 25:18.260
Since they asked me to guard here,

25:18.260 --> 25:19.420
I won't

25:19.450 --> 25:20.970
let anyone in.

25:21.050 --> 25:22.550
You and whose army?

25:30.480 --> 25:32.140
The Baize Token has returned?

25:44.620 --> 25:45.420
Hey.

25:46.440 --> 25:47.240
Hey!

25:56.540 --> 25:58.860
The Baize Token has returned.

26:00.860 --> 26:04.690
It's indeed delightful.

26:15.870 --> 26:17.830
It seems that

26:18.980 --> 26:20.450
very soon,

26:20.480 --> 26:23.860
my wish will come true.

26:54.300 --> 26:55.460
I'm not going.

26:55.560 --> 26:56.730
It's too scary.

27:05.000 --> 27:06.450
How could this be?

27:07.810 --> 27:10.140
Shouldn't he have been sealed

27:10.340 --> 27:12.080
and sent to his place of birth?

27:12.530 --> 27:14.850
Could it be that since he's lived for too long,

27:14.850 --> 27:17.290
the Baize Order no longer works on him?

27:18.260 --> 27:19.140
That can't be.

27:20.240 --> 27:22.640
All demons are under the Baize Order's control.

27:22.640 --> 27:24.030
As long as he's a demon,

27:24.390 --> 27:25.990
he'll definitely be sealed.

27:27.290 --> 27:28.380
Unless...

27:29.630 --> 27:31.230
Look at Cheng Huang's hands.

27:37.920 --> 27:38.810
Could it be...

27:39.070 --> 27:40.500
He's also a puppet?

27:48.140 --> 27:49.350
Appear.

27:59.320 --> 28:02.840
If I could rewind the clock,

28:03.030 --> 28:04.400
then she

28:05.230 --> 28:07.670
could smile again.

28:09.510 --> 28:11.310
How great that would be.

28:35.970 --> 28:38.060
♫The little city♫

28:38.130 --> 28:39.710
♫Traps♫

28:39.790 --> 28:42.030
♫The little us♫

28:42.280 --> 28:45.250
♫Going around and around♫

28:45.710 --> 28:47.140
♫Dusk and dawn♫

28:48.190 --> 28:50.310
♫The heavy door♫

28:50.570 --> 28:54.040
♫Who is waiting foolishly♫

28:54.560 --> 29:00.000
♫Reluctant, not asking, unreconciled, unwilling♫

29:00.650 --> 29:02.790
♫The pillow of the past♫

29:02.930 --> 29:03.940
♫Still has♫

29:04.520 --> 29:06.700
♫The warmth of the dream♫

29:06.750 --> 29:08.810
♫The dust from yesterday♫

29:09.130 --> 29:11.860
♫Covering my eyes♫

29:12.980 --> 29:14.950
♫The person in the dream♫

29:15.130 --> 29:16.590
♫Is silent♫

29:16.640 --> 29:18.800
♫Waiting with each step♫

29:17.380 --> 29:18.860
I hope my leaving

29:19.070 --> 29:22.280
♫Refuses to leave, and refuses♫

29:19.810 --> 29:22.130
can stop your killing.

29:22.360 --> 29:24.350
♫To turn around♫

29:23.550 --> 29:25.140
Don't carry any more sins

29:25.350 --> 29:29.000
♫The spring breeze, she seems to have♫

29:25.700 --> 29:28.600
that didn't belong to you for me.

29:29.110 --> 29:31.260
♫Many stories♫

29:31.310 --> 29:35.640
♫There's a name in her heart♫

29:37.710 --> 29:39.100
♫The human world♫

29:39.140 --> 29:41.420
♫The ink is mottled♫

29:41.500 --> 29:43.630
♫Love, hate, absurdity, mistakes♫

29:43.710 --> 29:45.080
♫Can't clearly write it♫

29:45.350 --> 29:46.600
♫Can't completely express it♫

29:46.550 --> 29:48.070
Bless everything.

29:46.890 --> 29:48.990
♫This karma♫

29:48.090 --> 29:49.550
Invulnerable to all evil.

29:49.790 --> 29:51.320
We promise to work together

29:52.790 --> 29:54.590
and guard the Wilderness.

30:05.110 --> 30:08.790
♫The spring breeze, she seems to have♫

30:09.050 --> 30:11.180
♫Too much on her mind♫

30:11.410 --> 30:15.800
♫There's a blank spot♫

30:17.620 --> 30:19.020
♫The human world♫

30:19.050 --> 30:21.250
♫The clouds in the sky♫

30:21.310 --> 30:23.600
♫The end of the bitter sea♫

30:23.630 --> 30:24.940
♫A dream♫

30:25.250 --> 30:26.500
♫A pair of hands♫

30:26.780 --> 30:28.910
♫A cup of wine♫

30:29.740 --> 30:33.630
♫The little city traps♫

30:33.630 --> 30:35.910
♫The little us♫

30:36.180 --> 30:39.090
♫Going around and around♫

30:39.560 --> 30:41.020
♫Dusk and dawn♫

30:42.050 --> 30:44.220
♫The heavy door♫

30:44.580 --> 30:48.090
♫Whose youth is behind it♫

30:48.440 --> 30:53.970
♫Reluctant, not asking, unreconciled, unwilling♫

30:54.500 --> 30:56.040
♫I'm waiting for♫

30:56.100 --> 30:57.570
♫A light♫

30:57.630 --> 31:00.270
♫And a person♫

30:58.640 --> 31:00.840
No wonder Cheng Huang has lived so long.

31:00.990 --> 31:02.790
So he has long been a puppet.

31:03.150 --> 31:04.520
And his obsession

31:04.550 --> 31:05.950
is actually so strong

31:06.030 --> 31:07.470
as to make a puppet

31:07.550 --> 31:10.670
as powerful as a real great demon.

31:24.610 --> 31:25.940
Something's not right.

31:28.520 --> 31:30.410
We've dealt with Cheng Huang.

31:31.240 --> 31:33.040
Why hasn't the sundial illusion

31:33.480 --> 31:35.270
dissipated?

31:40.250 --> 31:40.950
This sundial

31:40.950 --> 31:43.180
was found by you and Li Lun.

31:43.210 --> 31:45.150
Zhao Yuanzhou, do something.

31:46.090 --> 31:47.490
There's nothing I can do.

31:47.870 --> 31:50.270
But I believe the Goddess can do something.

31:50.430 --> 31:51.230
Me?

31:54.530 --> 31:56.330
Take a look at it, and you'll see.

32:02.800 --> 32:03.600
So beautiful.

32:06.810 --> 32:07.850
Wen Xiao.

32:08.190 --> 32:10.000
Why did you say it out loud?

32:12.750 --> 32:13.990
I mean

32:14.020 --> 32:16.150
these golden pupils are so beautiful.

32:25.410 --> 32:27.040
Will those eyes

32:27.060 --> 32:28.470
be like this forever?

32:28.940 --> 32:31.350
Only when she uses the power of the Baize Order

32:31.350 --> 32:33.020
will her pupils turn golden.

32:34.190 --> 32:35.580
You said there's something I can do.

32:35.580 --> 32:37.370
Do you mean by using these golden pupils?

32:37.370 --> 32:39.690
It's actually not hard to find the exit of the sundial.

32:39.690 --> 32:42.580
The Golden Pupils of Baize can break through any illusion.

32:42.580 --> 32:43.870
It's actually a more powerful version

32:43.870 --> 32:44.800
of the Truth Eye.

32:46.390 --> 32:48.600
You have the power of the Baize Goddess.

32:48.720 --> 32:51.000
Motivate the power in your blood.

32:51.580 --> 32:52.950
Where your will is,

32:53.200 --> 32:54.850
you can see the truth.

32:57.900 --> 32:59.600
Where my will is,

33:01.160 --> 33:02.720
I can see the truth.

33:23.760 --> 33:26.240
♫A lone boat drifts through the world♫

33:26.300 --> 33:28.900
♫The heart feels bitter, then sweet♫

33:29.240 --> 33:34.310
♫Can't distinguish night from day♫

33:35.600 --> 33:37.520
♫At the edge of the dreamscape♫

33:37.630 --> 33:40.200
♫Someone is longing for♫

33:40.320 --> 33:41.560
♫Softly calling for♫

33:41.800 --> 33:45.860
♫A past that can't be brought back♫

33:43.150 --> 33:44.070
We're back.

33:44.880 --> 33:46.120
Everything

33:47.060 --> 33:48.900
is like a dream.

33:52.670 --> 33:54.440
Since Ran Yi's case,

33:55.790 --> 33:58.190
it's like I've been having endless dreams.

34:02.190 --> 34:04.320
Now that the Baize Order has returned,

34:05.790 --> 34:08.270
Master should be at ease now.

34:11.030 --> 34:12.790
The moonlight is so beautiful tonight.

34:12.790 --> 34:13.870
Zhuo told me that

34:13.889 --> 34:15.690
most of those who say things like

34:15.790 --> 34:17.520
"the moonlight is like water",

34:18.190 --> 34:19.270
or "how can we

34:19.270 --> 34:20.800
fail this beautiful scene"

34:21.590 --> 34:23.580
have ulterior motives

34:23.980 --> 34:25.460
and evil intentions.

34:26.610 --> 34:27.400
Is that so?

34:34.510 --> 34:36.190
I've always wondered

34:37.270 --> 34:38.730
what kind of water this is.

34:39.870 --> 34:40.909
Let me try it.

34:59.540 --> 35:00.660
It's so bitter.

35:04.070 --> 35:05.790
The world is full of hardships.

35:05.790 --> 35:07.040
Life is suffering.

35:07.260 --> 35:08.600
I’m no exception.

35:10.080 --> 35:12.060
You love acting so much.

35:12.090 --> 35:13.470
I suspect your true form

35:13.470 --> 35:14.390
is not a monkey,

35:14.530 --> 35:15.850
but an opera stage.

35:16.500 --> 35:18.280
I'm a noble white ape, okay?

35:18.830 --> 35:20.270
I've said it 100 times.

35:21.180 --> 35:22.390
You seem to be writing

35:22.390 --> 35:24.510
on your notebook every day,

35:24.800 --> 35:26.130
but it's useless at all.

35:40.040 --> 35:41.650
So what are you drinking?

35:41.720 --> 35:42.810
Pear soup.

35:44.950 --> 35:46.410
I want a sip too.

35:47.690 --> 35:49.540
Zhuo made a big pot.

35:50.160 --> 35:51.960
I'll ask him to get you a bowl.

35:53.840 --> 35:55.140
No need.

36:08.770 --> 36:11.030
I want to take a trip back to Mount Kunlun.

36:13.650 --> 36:15.560
With my current situation,

36:16.320 --> 36:19.380
I'm not suitable for managing the Baize Token with you.

36:19.860 --> 36:21.550
I haven't found the key

36:21.570 --> 36:23.960
to putting the two halves of the Baize Token together.

36:23.960 --> 36:25.440
So I want to go back to the Wilderness

36:25.440 --> 36:28.040
to see if the old Mountain Gods like Ying Zhao

36:29.350 --> 36:30.810
have any ideas.

36:33.220 --> 36:34.840
So as a great demon,

36:35.210 --> 36:37.340
there are also times you feel inferior

36:37.650 --> 36:39.580
and feel like you don't deserve it?

36:41.880 --> 36:42.950
You are a Goddess,

36:44.430 --> 36:46.490
yet you feel inferior too, don't you?

36:57.310 --> 36:58.370
In the past,

36:59.620 --> 37:02.510
when all demons first heard my name,

37:03.980 --> 37:05.380
they were either afraid,

37:06.150 --> 37:07.220
awed,

37:08.700 --> 37:10.100
or delighted.

37:13.030 --> 37:15.160
But soon after, they found out that

37:16.010 --> 37:17.840
I don't have any divine power,

37:18.660 --> 37:20.490
and I can't help them

37:21.080 --> 37:22.790
or discipline them.

37:26.190 --> 37:28.030
That's why I learned so much knowledge

37:28.030 --> 37:29.480
about demons

37:30.510 --> 37:32.430
in the hope that I could help them.

37:38.790 --> 37:40.190
But

37:41.270 --> 37:43.070
it's still useless.

37:48.280 --> 37:49.430
That's not true.

37:50.180 --> 37:52.310
You know even more than me, a great demon

37:52.310 --> 37:54.040
who has lived for 30,000 years.

37:54.550 --> 37:56.810
Besides, with the Baize Order's return,

37:56.910 --> 37:58.910
you won't get any weaker from now on.

37:59.210 --> 38:01.220
You'll get better

38:01.660 --> 38:03.530
and become more and more capable.

38:05.100 --> 38:07.070
No wonder on the way back from Qinghu,

38:07.070 --> 38:08.150
Zhuo said

38:08.870 --> 38:11.000
he felt like my physique had improved.

38:11.730 --> 38:14.790
Although I fell into the trap of Ran Yi's dream control magic,

38:14.790 --> 38:16.790
my body wasn't affected.

38:18.550 --> 38:20.370
Maybe it's because

38:21.110 --> 38:22.830
you've been by my side.

38:23.910 --> 38:26.110
That half of the Baize Token in your body

38:26.470 --> 38:28.090
has been giving me power

38:29.050 --> 38:30.110
and protecting me.

38:31.370 --> 38:34.340
Is Baize Token the only thing that's been protecting you?

38:34.340 --> 38:35.490
What about me?

38:40.170 --> 38:41.230
Alright. Alright.

38:42.450 --> 38:44.240
You're really something.

38:44.430 --> 38:47.630
Now you can control me, a big white ape, with just one look.

38:47.790 --> 38:48.600
Impressive.

38:54.710 --> 38:56.970
It doesn't matter if I can't control you.

38:58.670 --> 39:00.060
But I want to cure you.

39:01.530 --> 39:03.130
Why?

39:03.360 --> 39:04.330
I'm not sick.

39:06.350 --> 39:07.500
You are.

39:11.890 --> 39:12.710
Here.

39:29.840 --> 39:32.300
You actually want to cure a great evil demon?

39:32.730 --> 39:34.040
You're also sick.

39:34.700 --> 39:35.430
Here.

39:40.200 --> 39:42.100
When are we leaving for Kunlun?

39:42.120 --> 39:43.670
I'll go to Kunlun with you.

39:49.550 --> 39:50.710
Mr. Zhuo.

39:51.800 --> 39:55.200
I don't trust this demon. I don't want you to be alone with him.

39:56.810 --> 39:58.560
Mr. Zhuo...

40:06.820 --> 40:07.820
Take me with you.

40:10.310 --> 40:11.270
Brother Zhuo.

40:11.350 --> 40:12.480
Take me with you.

40:14.800 --> 40:15.680
Sure.

40:16.390 --> 40:17.340
Great.

40:19.540 --> 40:20.310
Mr. Zhuo.

40:20.320 --> 40:23.120
What delicious food are you carrying in your hand?

40:26.530 --> 40:27.480
Pear soup.

40:29.290 --> 40:31.220
Wen Xiao has had it.

40:31.240 --> 40:33.070
So is it for me?

40:34.330 --> 40:35.060
Ridiculous.

40:35.570 --> 40:37.230
I'm feeding it to the dogs.

40:40.590 --> 40:42.740
Wen Xiao, that's not what I meant.

40:44.800 --> 40:45.600
I...

40:46.500 --> 40:47.320
You...

40:56.650 --> 40:58.060
Jiu.

41:03.990 --> 41:04.750
Brother Zhuo.

41:04.750 --> 41:06.030
Wait for me.

41:06.030 --> 41:06.830
Brother Zhuo.

41:07.760 --> 41:09.560
Fortunately, I didn't drink it.

41:30.020 --> 41:30.830
Jiu.

41:31.350 --> 41:32.150
Come here.

41:40.470 --> 41:41.290
Jiu.

41:42.440 --> 41:44.840
Are you sure you want to go to Kunlun with us?

41:45.150 --> 41:45.750
Yes.

41:46.830 --> 41:47.550
No one knows

41:47.550 --> 41:49.310
what will happen on this trip.

41:49.420 --> 41:51.990
There will be many demons along the way.

41:52.870 --> 41:53.930
Aren't you afraid?

42:04.170 --> 42:04.960
Jiu.

42:09.190 --> 42:11.110
With this, I'm not afraid.

42:14.090 --> 42:16.290
Why do you like holding my bells so much?

42:17.480 --> 42:18.990
I'm too timid.

42:19.690 --> 42:20.510
But

42:20.530 --> 42:23.110
whenever I hear the bells on your braids ringing,

42:23.110 --> 42:24.190
I know

42:24.380 --> 42:26.180
you're by my side, Brother Zhuo,

42:26.710 --> 42:28.650
and I feel safe.

42:28.670 --> 42:30.930
Even if there are demons, I'm not afraid.

42:34.970 --> 42:36.370
So, Mr. Zhuo,

42:36.910 --> 42:37.870
why do you always

42:37.870 --> 42:39.750
put bells on your braids?

42:48.460 --> 42:49.490
When I was a kid,

42:50.850 --> 42:54.380
my older brother used to practice swordsmanship in the garden.

42:57.220 --> 43:01.120
♫Footsteps echo, one by one♫

42:57.820 --> 42:59.510
He was afraid I'd get lost,

42:59.770 --> 43:01.600
so he tied many bells

43:01.630 --> 43:04.580
♫Sorrows scattered, lost to the wind♫

43:01.670 --> 43:03.560
on my braids.

43:05.750 --> 43:09.620
♫Not forgetting, nor dwelling on♫

43:06.160 --> 43:09.180
As long as he heard the sound of the bells,

43:09.850 --> 43:12.810
♫The way back home♫

43:10.270 --> 43:11.430
he would know

43:11.450 --> 43:12.730
I didn't go far.

43:13.530 --> 43:15.140
♫With strong will♫

43:15.520 --> 43:19.100
♫I slowly carve out♫

43:19.660 --> 43:21.440
♫Growth♫

43:22.010 --> 43:23.650
♫Turning back♫

43:24.050 --> 43:27.430
♫I find you still in that familiar place♫

43:28.160 --> 43:30.030
♫Waiting there♫

43:28.270 --> 43:29.910
So when I first met you,

43:30.490 --> 43:31.900
I saw the dangling bell

43:31.930 --> 43:33.750
in your hair,

43:34.360 --> 43:35.990
and it reminded me of myself.

43:37.480 --> 43:40.430
My bells were put on by my brother

43:41.370 --> 43:43.630
because he was worried that I'd get lost.

43:44.110 --> 43:45.270
What about yours?

43:47.700 --> 43:49.080
I put it on because I was worried

43:49.080 --> 43:50.410
no one would look for me,

43:51.530 --> 43:52.860
and no one would find me.

43:56.380 --> 43:57.770
When I was little,

43:58.380 --> 44:00.840
I used to play hide-and-seek with my mother.

44:00.940 --> 44:03.470
I was worried that my mother couldn't find me,

44:05.840 --> 44:08.390
so I tied a bell on my braid.

44:08.420 --> 44:11.220
This way, my mother would always be able to find me.

44:13.950 --> 44:15.150
But soon afterwards,

44:17.040 --> 44:19.640
no one played hide-and-seek with me anymore.
